This requirement applies even if no copy of the Modified Work is otherwise distributed to those users.

This section does not authorise Commercial Use. Commercial network or hosted use remains prohibited unless separately licensed in writing.

## 14. Modified Works Remain Non-Commercial

Copyrightable material derived from Covered Material remains subject to this licence.

You may not relicense such derived material on terms that permit Commercial Use.

You may not convert covered material into proprietary commercial software or remove its Non-Commercial restriction.

This section does not claim ownership of independently created code, ideas, algorithms, scientific principles, methods, facts or material that does not copy or derive from copyrightable expression contained in Covered Material.

