Unless a separate written agreement states otherwise, a contributor must grant the Copyright Holder sufficient rights to use, reproduce and modify the contribution; prepare derivative works from it; incorporate it into the Software or Project Content; distribute and publicly make it available; sublicense it; relicense it under this licence or another licence; and license it as part of a separate commercial licence.

