For a first violation that is reasonably capable of remedy and is not deliberate commercial exploitation, deliberate false attribution or deliberate concealment of provenance, Your licence will continue if:

a. You receive written notice identifying the violation;

b. You come into full compliance within 30 days of receiving that notice; and

