A repeated violation, deliberate unauthorised Commercial Use, deliberate false claim of authorship, or deliberate removal of provenance for the purpose of misrepresentation may result in immediate termination of rights granted by this licence.

Termination does not remove rights or remedies arising from infringement or breach occurring before termination.

The Copyright Holder may reinstate permission in writing.

